Feature: Home page
  As a visitor
  I want the home page to load correctly
  So that I know the Astro site is working

  Scenario: Home page loads and is generated by Astro
    Given I am on the homepage
    Then the page should be generated by Astro
    And I should see "Welcome to the Astro Steps Demo Site"
    And the page title should end with "| Astro Steps Demo"

  Scenario: Home page links to About and Blog
    Given I am on the homepage
    Then the "Learn more about this project" link should contain "/about/"
    And the "Read the blog" link should contain "/blog/"

  Scenario: Navigation menu is present with the main pages
    Given I am on the homepage
    Then I should see a navigation menu with the following links:
      | text  | path    |
      | Home  | /       |
      | About | /about  |
      | Blog  | /blog   |
      | Contact | /contact |

  Scenario: All navigation links resolve successfully
    Given I am on the homepage
    Then all navigation links should resolve successfully
